{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cek4rviLLBJaBZQMcjYKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This confirms it directly. Commit 888867c changed the code from computing the relative path (`path.toString().replaceAll(location + File.separator, \"\")`) to just using `path.getFileName().toString()`, which strips the directory structure and only shows the filename. The very next commit (c05dbd1) fixes this by reverting to using the relative path via `location.relativize(path)`.\n\n## Bug-Introducing Commits\nBIC: 888867c602e6969d278f2f7f141004c3bd7d1b38\n\n## Reasoning\n(1) I traced the history of `FileHandler.java` with `git log --follow` and found the fixing commit's direct parent, `888867c` (\"Use Path instead of Strings to avoid OS-specifics\"), immediately preceding it.\n\n(2) That commit refactored `fileMatcher` to use `Path` objects instead of string manipulation. In doing so, it changed:\n```java\nString tempPath = (path.toString().replaceAll(location + File.separator, \"\")).toLowerCase();\n```\nto:\n```java\nPath fileName = path.getFileName();\n...\nString tempPath = fileName.toString();\n```\nThe old code stripped only the `location` prefix, leaving the relative path (including subdirectories) intact. The new code calls `path.getFileName()`, which discards all directory components and keeps only the final filename — exactly the bug described in the fix (\"only showed the filename without suffix\"/full path).\n\n(3) The fixing commit's diff changes precisely this line back to preserving the relative path: `String tempPath = location.relativize(path).toString();`, replacing the `fileName.toString()` introduced in `888867c`. This is a one-line revert of the specific regression, strongly confirming `888867c` as the bug-introducing commit. I'm highly confident in this identification since the fix directly undoes this single line change with no other intervening commits touching this file."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":12861,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa404fba-7667-436e-b26a-6b05e4889d6c","uuid":"018c001e-1de9-4547-8844-82e9ea4a981c","timestamp":"2026-09-05T09:37:16.688Z","request_id":"req_011Cek4ruxwNXEqT9BAxyquK"}
